cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "brmangue-terrame: BR-MANGUE adapted to TerraME 2.0, with a headless driver for reference outputs"
abstract: >-
  Adaptation of the BR-MANGUE coupled flood and mangrove model (Bezerra, 2014)
  to TerraME 2.0, with a headless driver (golden.lua) that writes the per-step
  reference outputs used to validate the Python re-implementation
  brmangue-dissmodel.
authors:
